    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Today we are deciding: Find an unniversity presentation topic in the course about biology",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Here are the options on the table:",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Option A - The Helix Institute: offers in-depth analysis of genetic engineering; trade-off: slower paced; best for: students prioritizing comprehensive understanding",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Option B - EcoCycle Conference: provides a broad overview of environmental biology; trade-off: higher cost; best for: learners seeking a wide range of topics",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Option C - The Biosphere Summit: focuses on innovative applications in biotechnology; trade-off: less emphasis on foundational knowledge; best for: attendees interested in cutting-edge research",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Option D - The Cellarius Symposium: explores the intricacies of cellular biology; trade-off: narrower scope; best for: those looking to specialize in microscopic biology",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 0,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "What aspect of biology should our presentation prioritize to engage the audience most effectively?",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 0,
      "tokens_out": 0
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 1,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Ava",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "Hi, I think innovative applications are key",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 937,
      "tokens_out": 9
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 2,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Liam",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "Hi, hoping for a balance between unique topics and practical feasibility",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 926,
      "tokens_out": 13
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 3,
      "phase": "opening",
      "speaker": "Ethan",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "Hi, I think scientific merit is crucial",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 913,
      "tokens_out": 9
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 4,
      "phase": "negotiation",
      "speaker": "Ava",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "Scientific merit is important but what about real world impact?",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 997,
      "tokens_out": 13
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 5,
      "phase": "negotiation",
      "speaker": "Liam",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "Real world impact is huge, but we also need to consider what's realistically achievable.",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 940,
      "tokens_out": 18
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 6,
      "phase": "negotiation",
      "speaker": "Ava",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "What's realistically achievable with cutting-edge biotech?",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 957,
      "tokens_out": 11
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 6,
      "phase": "negotiation",
      "speaker": "Moderator",
      "is_moderator": true,
      "text": "Isn't specified, decide based on what's listed.",
      "selected_reason": "moderator",
      "tokens_in": 529,
      "tokens_out": 12
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 7,
      "phase": "negotiation",
      "speaker": "Liam",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "Not enough info to judge cutting-edge biotech's feasibility.",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 921,
      "tokens_out": 13
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 8,
      "phase": "negotiation",
      "speaker": "Ethan",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "Liam's right, achievable goals matter, what's the trade-off for EcoCycle's broad overview?",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 946,
      "tokens_out": 22
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 9,
      "phase": "negotiation",
      "speaker": "Liam",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "EcoCycle's higher cost is a trade-off for its broad overview.",
      "selected_reason": "forced",
      "tokens_in": 946,
      "tokens_out": 16
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 10,
      "phase": "negotiation",
      "speaker": "Ethan",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "Is the cost worth the breadth of topics covered?",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 960,
      "tokens_out": 11
    },
    {
      "turn_index": 11,
      "phase": "negotiation",
      "speaker": "Ava",
      "is_moderator": false,
      "text": "Does breadth of topics necessarily mean depth in innovative applications?",
      "selected_reason": "weighted",
      "tokens_in": 939,
